1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,192
Vic: Chat, rescue is coming. I can hear a
helicopter!

2
00:00:03,512 --> 00:00:08,735
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part six of ten: the helicopter.

3
00:00:09,055 --> 00:00:10,865
Priya: Vic. That's a mosquito.

4
00:00:11,185 --> 00:00:13,195
Vic: A helicopter will see us. We just
wait.

5
00:00:13,315 --> 00:00:15,170
Priya: Waiting in the dark is not a
signal.

6
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,144
Dante: ...A flare is also a nice light.

7
00:00:17,464 --> 00:00:22,526
Rosa: Hilltop. Open sky. One hungry crowd
below.

8
00:00:22,846 --> 00:00:26,861
Dante: Teddy. Hold the flare. Wave Gary!

9
00:00:26,981 --> 00:00:27,811
Teddy: Gary is waving!

10
00:00:28,131 --> 00:00:29,942
Teddy: A helicopter! ...It's a pizza
drone.

11
00:00:30,062 --> 00:00:31,607
Dante: Pizza? ...Is it hot?

12
00:00:31,927 --> 00:00:35,013
Teddy: Gary says wave, then walk. Waving
alone is dancing.

13
00:00:35,333 --> 00:00:38,583
Priya: Real rule. Signal for help, then
keep moving.

14
00:00:38,903 --> 00:00:41,418
Steve: Excuse me. Is that my ride?

15
00:00:41,538 --> 00:00:43,265
Rosa: It's a pizza drone, Steve.

16
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:44,789
Dante: The pizza was cold.

17
00:00:45,185 --> 00:00:47,355
June: Cold pizza is still pizza, dear.

18
00:00:47,675 --> 00:00:51,751
BUS-E: Steve's seat is number thirteen.
This bus has twelve seats. Cozy!

19
00:00:52,071 --> 00:00:59,571
BUS-E: Part six of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the cans. Follow for part seven.

